#: src/lib/components/custom/About.svelte
msgid "Sylve is a lightweight control plane for the <0>FreeBSD ecosystem</0>, unifying Bhyve, Jails, ZFS, PF, and more into a streamlined management interface. Powered by a high-performance Go backend and a responsive SvelteKit frontend, it makes complex infrastructure simple."
msgstr "Sylve é un plano de control lixeiro para o <0>ecosistema FreeBSD</0>, que unifica Bhyve, Jails, ZFS, PF e máis nunha interface de xestión simplificada. Impulsado por un backend Go de alto rendemento e un frontend SvelteKit responsivo, simplifica infraestruturas complexas."

